 165:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sram.c **** /**
 166:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sram.c ****   * @brief  Performs the SRAM device initialization sequence
 167:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sram.c ****   * @param  hsram pointer to a SRAM_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
 168:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_sram.c ****   *                the configuration information for SRAM module.
